$ kluris help status --json
== stdout
{"ok": true, "commands": [{"name": "status", "description": "Show brain tree, recent changes, and neuron counts"}]}
== stderr
== exit 0
$ kluris help bogus --json
== stdout
{"ok": false, "error": "Unknown command: bogus"}
== stderr
== exit 1
$ kluris help pack --json
== stdout
{"ok": false, "error": "Unknown command: pack"}
== stderr
== exit 1
